{"id":91,"name":"Ash-Shams","nameAr":"الشمس","nameFr":"Le soleil","place":"makkah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"91:1","fr":"Par le soleil et par sa clarté !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091001.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلشَّمْسِ","en":"By the sun","tr":"wal-shamsi","l":"شَمْس","r":"شمس","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَضُحَىٰهَا","en":"and its brightness","tr":"waḍuḥāhā","l":"ضُحًى","r":"ضحو","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_001_002.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"91:2","fr":"Et par la lune quand elle le suit !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091002.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلْقَمَرِ","en":"And the moon","tr":"wal-qamari","l":"قَمَر","r":"قمر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"إِذَا","en":"when","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/091_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"تَلَىٰهَا","en":"it follows it","tr":"talāhā","l":"تَلَى","r":"تلو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_002_003.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"91:3","fr":"Et par le jour quand il l’éclaire !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091003.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلنَّهَارِ","en":"And the day","tr":"wal-nahāri","l":"نَهار","r":"نهر","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_003_001.mp3"},{"t":"إِذَا","en":"when","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/091_003_002.mp3"},{"t":"جَلَّىٰهَا","en":"it displays it","tr":"jallāhā","l":"جَلَّى","r":"جلو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_003_003.mp3"}]},{"n":4,"k":"91:4","fr":"Et par la nuit quand elle l’enveloppe !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091004.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلَّيْلِ","en":"And the night","tr":"wa-al-layli","l":"لَيْل","r":"ليل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_004_001.mp3"},{"t":"إِذَا","en":"when","tr":"idhā","l":"إِذا","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/091_004_002.mp3"},{"t":"يَغْشَىٰهَا","en":"it covers it","tr":"yaghshāhā","l":"غَشِيَ","r":"غشو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_004_003.mp3"}]},{"n":5,"k":"91:5","fr":"Et par le ciel et Celui qui l’a construit !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091005.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلسَّمَآءِ","en":"And the heaven","tr":"wal-samāi","l":"سَماء","r":"سمو","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_005_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and (He) Who","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/091_005_002.mp3"},{"t":"بَنَىٰهَا","en":"constructed it","tr":"banāhā","l":"بَنَى","r":"بني","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_005_003.mp3"}]},{"n":6,"k":"91:6","fr":"Et par la terre et Celui qui l’a étendue !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091006.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en":"And the earth","tr":"wal-arḍi","l":"أَرْض","r":"أرض","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_006_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and by (He) Who","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/091_006_002.mp3"},{"t":"طَحَىٰهَا","en":"spread it","tr":"ṭaḥāhā","l":"طَحَى","r":"طحو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_006_003.mp3"}]},{"n":7,"k":"91:7","fr":"Et par l’âme et Celui qui l’a harmonieusement façonnée ;","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091007.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَنَفْسٍۢ","en":"And (the) soul","tr":"wanafsin","l":"نَفْس","r":"نفس","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_007_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and (He) Who","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/091_007_002.mp3"},{"t":"سَوَّىٰهَا","en":"proportioned it","tr":"sawwāhā","l":"سَوَّى","r":"سوي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_007_003.mp3"}]},{"n":8,"k":"91:8","fr":"et lui a alors inspiré son immoralité, de même que sa piété !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091008.mp3","w":[{"t":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا","en":"And He inspired it","tr":"fa-alhamahā","l":"أَلْهَمَ","r":"لهم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_008_001.mp3"},{"t":"فُجُورَهَا","en":"(to distinguish) its wickedness","tr":"fujūrahā","l":"فُجُور","r":"فجر","p":"particule","a":"wbw/091_008_002.mp3"},{"t":"وَتَقْوَىٰهَا","en":"and its righteousness","tr":"wataqwāhā","l":"تَقْوَى","r":"وقي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/091_008_003.mp3"}]},{"n":9,"k":"91:9","fr":"A réussi, certes celui qui la purifie.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091009.mp3","w":[{"t":"قَدْ","en":"Indeed","tr":"qad","l":"قَد","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/091_009_001.mp3"},{"t":"أَفْلَحَ","en":"he succeeds","tr":"aflaḥa","l":"أَفْلَحَ","r":"فلح","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_009_002.mp3"},{"t":"مَن","en":"who","tr":"man","l":"مَن","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/091_009_003.mp3"},{"t":"زَكَّىٰهَا","en":"purifies it","tr":"zakkāhā","l":"زَكَّى","r":"زكو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_009_004.mp3"}]},{"n":10,"k":"91:10","fr":"Et est perdu, certes, celui qui la corrompt.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091010.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَقَدْ","en":"And indeed","tr":"waqad","l":"قَد","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/091_010_001.mp3"},{"t":"خَابَ","en":"he fails","tr":"khāba","l":"خابَ","r":"خيب","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_010_002.mp3"},{"t":"مَن","en":"who","tr":"man","l":"مَن","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/091_010_003.mp3"},{"t":"دَسَّىٰهَا","en":"buries it","tr":"dassāhā","l":"دَسَّى","r":"دسو","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_010_004.mp3"}]},{"n":11,"k":"91:11","fr":"Les Thamûd, par leur transgression, ont crié au mensonge,","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091011.mp3","w":[{"t":"كَذَّبَتْ","en":"Denied","tr":"kadhabat","l":"كَذَّبَ","r":"كذب","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_011_001.mp3"},{"t":"ثَمُودُ","en":"Thamud","tr":"thamūdu","l":"ثَمُود","r":null,"p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/091_011_002.mp3"},{"t":"بِطَغْوَىٰهَآ","en":"by their transgression","tr":"biṭaghwāhā","l":"طَغْوَى","r":"طغي","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_011_003.mp3"}]},{"n":12,"k":"91:12","fr":"lorsque le plus misérable d’entre eux se leva (pour tuer la chamelle)","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091012.mp3","w":[{"t":"إِذِ","en":"When","tr":"idhi","l":"إِذ","r":null,"p":"temps","a":"wbw/091_012_001.mp3"},{"t":"ٱنۢبَعَثَ","en":"(was) sent forth","tr":"inbaʿatha","l":"انۢبَعَثَ","r":"بعث","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_012_002.mp3"},{"t":"أَشْقَىٰهَا","en":"(the) most wicked of them","tr":"ashqāhā","l":"أَشْقَى","r":"شقو","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_012_003.mp3"}]},{"n":13,"k":"91:13","fr":"Le Messager d’Allah leur avait dit : \"La chamelle d’Allah ! Laissez-la boire.\"","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091013.mp3","w":[{"t":"فَقَالَ","en":"But said","tr":"faqāla","l":"قالَ","r":"قول","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_013_001.mp3"},{"t":"لَهُمْ","en":"to them","tr":"lahum","l":"لَهُمْ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/091_013_002.mp3"},{"t":"رَسُولُ","en":"(the) Messenger","tr":"rasūlu","l":"رَسُول","r":"رسل","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_013_003.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"(of) Allah","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/091_013_004.mp3"},{"t":"نَاقَةَ","en":"(It is the) she-camel","tr":"nāqata","l":"ناقَة","r":"نوق","p":"particule","a":"wbw/091_013_005.mp3"},{"t":"ٱللَّهِ","en":"(of) Allah","tr":"l-lahi","l":"اللَّه","r":"أله","p":"nom propre","a":"wbw/091_013_006.mp3"},{"t":"وَسُقْيَـٰهَا","en":"and her drink","tr":"wasuq'yāhā","l":"سُقْيا","r":"سقي","p":"particule","a":"wbw/091_013_007.mp3"}]},{"n":14,"k":"91:14","fr":"Mais, ils le traitèrent de menteur, et la tuèrent. Leur Seigneur les détruisit donc, pour leur péché et étendit Son châtiment sur tous.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091014.mp3","w":[{"t":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","en":"But they denied him","tr":"fakadhabūhu","l":"كَذَّبَ","r":"كذب","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_014_001.mp3"},{"t":"فَعَقَرُوهَا","en":"and they hamstrung her","tr":"faʿaqarūhā","l":"عَقَرَ","r":"عقر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_014_002.mp3"},{"t":"فَدَمْدَمَ","en":"So destroyed","tr":"fadamdama","l":"دَمْدَمَ","r":"دمدم","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_014_003.mp3"},{"t":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en":"them","tr":"ʿalayhim","l":"عَلَى","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/091_014_004.mp3"},{"t":"رَبُّهُم","en":"their Lord","tr":"rabbuhum","l":"رَبّ","r":"ربب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_014_005.mp3"},{"t":"بِذَنۢبِهِمْ","en":"for their sin","tr":"bidhanbihim","l":"ذَنب","r":"ذنب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/091_014_006.mp3"},{"t":"فَسَوَّىٰهَا","en":"and leveled them","tr":"fasawwāhā","l":"سَوَّى","r":"سوي","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_014_007.mp3"}]},{"n":15,"k":"91:15","fr":"Et Allah n’a aucune crainte des conséquences.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/091015.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَلَا","en":"And not","tr":"walā","l":"لا","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/091_015_001.mp3"},{"t":"يَخَافُ","en":"He fears","tr":"yakhāfu","l":"خافَ","r":"خوف","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/091_015_002.mp3"},{"t":"عُقْبَـٰهَا","en":"its consequences","tr":"ʿuq'bāhā","l":"عُقْبَى","r":"عقب","p":"particule","a":"wbw/091_015_003.mp3"}]}]}